BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Oldest Person in the World
DTSTART:20261202T033000Z
DTEND:20261202T051000Z
DTSTAMP:20261202T033000Z
UID:oi8v8qgZK8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 82 mins (1h22m)\n\nA decade-long global journey chro
 nicles the ever-changing record holders of the title of oldest person aliv
 e. What begins as a portrait of longevity becomes a meditation on the pass
 age of time\, the randomness of fate\, and the joy and profound human expe
 rience of being alive. Virtual Q&A with Director Sam Green\n\nhttps://www
 .siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-oldest-person-in-the-world\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
