UID:RdNGnyxOxM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nIn a small rural village\, local
  superstition becomes terrifyingly real when a ravenous creature begins to
  stalk the countryside. While a local farmer struggles beneath the weight 
 of a werewolf curse\, a ruthless hunter begins a campaign to eradicate wol
 ves. A harrowing tale of devotion\, damnation and the devil within. Ticke
 ts on sale Tuesday\, November 24\, at 5:00am.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cine
 ma/in-theaters/werwulf\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
